            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The spectrum of occupational disease seen in the food industry mainly includes occupational asthma (and/or rhinitis), hypersensitivity pneumonitis and dermatitis. The differences between the Occupational Reactions to Food Allergens and Food Allergy are discussed.</AbstractText>
